   * validated inference credential (resolveInferenceTenant → org-<id>/user-<id>).
   * No current caller sets this (see packet trace); untrusted callers MUST leave
   * it undefined. It is the ONLY input that can raise the canonical receipt to
   * `authenticated_tenant` (a trusted `source`, e.g. 'inference_auth').
